sequenceDiagram
  participant UI as UI
  participant DB as Local DB
  participant Q as Outbox queue
  participant S as Server
  UI->>DB: Write change (optimistic)
  DB-->>UI: Updated immediately
  DB->>Q: Enqueue mutation with idempotency key
  Note over Q: Offline: wait for network
  Q->>S: Push when online, retry with backoff
  S-->>Q: Ack or conflict
  S-->>DB: Pull changes since last cursor
  DB-->>UI: Live query refreshes
